Spring Authorization Server
================================================================================

The database schema in

    src/main/resources/db/migration/V1__authorization_server_schema.sql

is derived from the schema shipped with Spring Authorization Server 1.5.x:

    org/springframework/security/oauth2/server/authorization/
        oauth2-authorization-schema.sql
    org/springframework/security/oauth2/server/authorization/client/
        oauth2-registered-client-schema.sql

