Modifications
-------------

The two files were combined into a single Flyway migration and adapted for
PostgreSQL, following the instructions in the header of the originals:

  - blob columns changed to text
  - timestamp columns changed to timestamptz, so that instants are stored
    accurately
  - the consent table was omitted; this server implements no authorization
    consent flow

The indexes in V2__authorization_server_indexes.sql are original work and are
covered by this project's MIT license.


